OL,3,CFormer footballer Jamie Carragher will
OL,4,Cnot be made bankrupt
OL,6,FThe former Liverpool defender Jamie
OL,7,FCarragher has settled an unpaid tax
OL,8,Fbill with HMRC - meaning he will not
OL,9,Fbe made bankrupt.
OL,11,FAt a hearing at the Insolvency and
OL,12,FCompanies Court on Tuesday October 13,
OL,13,FJudge Nicholas Briggs dismissed a
OL,14,Fbankruptcy petition against the 48-
OL,15,Fyear-old.
OL,17,FThe petition was issued in August, but
OL,18,FKevin Hassan, for HMRC, told the
OL,19,Fhearing in London that the debt has
OL,20,Fbeen paid.
